<p><span style="font-family:新細明體,serif"><span style="background:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;微軟正黑體&quot;,sans-serif">透過本說明會透過本次說明會，您將深入了解課程特色、師資陣容與校友資源，開啟未來職涯成長的新契機。</span></span><b><span lang="EN-US"><span style="font-family:&quot;微軟正黑體&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="letter-spacing:3.0pt"></span></span></span></b></span></p>

